  "description": "Behind Seo Seon-Ui's harmless, gentle face lies a dangerous well of hidden violence. He manages to keep his volatile temper suppressed. That is... Until Ohn Ju-Hyeok, a senior at his university, approaches him with a video capturing a brutal assault from Seon-Ui's past. Expecting blackmail, Seon-Ui prepares for the worst, only for Ju-Hyeok to make an utterly bewildering request: \n\n*\"Could you hit me, too? Just like in this video.\"*\n\nConfronted by Ju-Hyeok's incomprehensible and taboo desire, Seon-Ui tries to keep his distance. However, he gradually finds himself drawn into a dark, twisted dynamic where pain and pleasure become inextricably linked.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
